entation requirement\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"PMS 系统\"<|>\"估算书\"<|>\"Estimation books must match data fields like total investment found in the PMS system, and files are imported from this system.\"<|>\"data consistency, system integration\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"第三方编制的估算书\"<|>\"电力工程造价专业执业资格专用章\"<|>\"Third-party estimation books require the editor, reviewer, and approver to affix this specific professional qualification seal.\"<|>\"regulatory compliance, authorization\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分包管理\"<|>\"249 号文\"<|>\"Subcontracting management procedures must reference the regulations outlined in Document No. 249.\"<|>\"regulatory reference, policy adherence\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"74 号文\"<|>\"分包管理\"<|>\"Document No. 74 is explicitly stated as abolished and cannot be used as a reference for current subcontracting management.\"<|>\"policy change, invalidation\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"费用计取原则\"<|>\"96 号文\"<|>\"Principles for calculating various fees, such as those for special regions or supervision, are based on regulations in Document No. 96.\"<|>\"fee calculation, regulatory basis\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"承包合同\"<|>\"国网模板\"<|>\"Subcontracting contracts for production technology renovation and major repair projects must utilize the State Grid template.\"<|>\"standardization, contract requirement\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分包合同\"<|>\"农民工工资支付流程\"<|>\"Subcontracting contracts must explicitly define the process for paying migrant worker wages.\"<|>\"labor rights, contractual obligation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"生产技改结算报告\"<|>\"竣工验收\"<|>\"The submission deadline for the production technology renovation settlement report is triggered by the completion acceptance event.\"<|>\"timeline, administrative procedure\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"设备大修结算报告\"<|>\"竣工验收\"<|>\"The submission deadline for the equipment major repair settlement report is triggered by the completion acceptance event.\"<|>\"timeline, administrative procedure\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"project estimation, cost management, subcontracting regulations, compliance requirements, settlement reporting, PMS system\")<|COMPLETE|>"
