enting non-standard construction or unrelated additions, implying restrictions on budget adjustments.\"<|>\"budget control, standard compliance\"<|>5)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"续建项目\"<|>\"资金调减\"<|>\"Funds incurred in previous years for continuing construction projects cannot be arbitrarily reduced.\"<|>\"fund protection, continuity\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目调整\"<|>\"总部\"<|>\"When investment changes exceed 15% due to bidding factors, deviation details must be submitted to the headquarters.\"<|>\"reporting requirement, oversight\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"自主实施的项目\"<|>\"计划调整\"<|>\"Self-implemented projects must undergo timely plan adjustments to reduce fees based on actuals and avoid waste.\"<|>\"cost control, procedural compliance\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"settlement audit, project adjustment, budget management, regulatory compliance, emergency repairs, digital projects\")<|COMPLETE|>"
