    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"生产技术改造\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category involving the use of mature, advanced, applicable technologies and equipment to update, perfect, and equip existing power grid production assets, forming fixed assets as capital expenditure.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产设备大修\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category referring to repair work managed by projects to restore the original form and capability of assets (equipment, facilities, auxiliary facilities), not increasing the original value of fixed assets, classified as a loss expense.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网基建项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Projects characterized by expanding grid scale or capacity, building whole stations or lines, and improving transmission capacity through whole transformer or bay renovations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产辅助基建\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"New construction, expansion, and purchase of non-operating production support facilities such as dispatch control, management, operation maintenance, marketing service, warehousing, research, education, and other housing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"营销计量检测项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Projects involving investment in electricity business, energy metering, market and energy efficiency, smart electricity, and supply services, including renovation of metering centers and business outlets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"固定资产零购项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Fixed assets that are not managed as engineering projects in the company's catalog, can function independently, and have no architectural installation workload, such as instruments, tools, and transport vehicles.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"数字化项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Projects involving enterprise information integration platforms, business applications, and information security system construction/renovation, focusing on management information equipment and pure software systems.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"日常费用项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Daily operations and maintenance activities including inspection, cleaning, maintenance, periodic comprehensive overhaul, minor repairs, testing, debugging, tree trimming, grass weeding, snow removal, and low-value consumable replacement.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"特高压套管\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"High-cost components whose replacement can be classified as either production technology renovation or major overhaul under special circumstances.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"110kV 及以下避雷器\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Lightning arresters at 110kV and below where line addition or replacement can be classified as major overhaul.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"杆塔\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Towers in transmission lines; replacing more than 5 towers in a single line is tentatively classified as technology renovation, while fewer than 5 can be major overhaul or renovation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电缆\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Cables where replacement not exceeding 50% of the line asset value can be listed as major overhaul, otherwise technology renovation; high-voltage power cables (10kV and above) can be listed as technology renovation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"主变\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Main transformers; new additions are included in infrastructure, while capacity increase renovations are generally infrastructure but can be technology renovation if infrastructure funds are insufficient. Old replacements and efficiency upgrades can be technology renovation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"开关柜\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Switchgear cabinets; adding them without new outgoing lines can be listed as technology renovation, while adding outgoing intervals should be listed as infrastructure projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"视频会议显示屏\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Video conference display screens and related equipment; new additions or renovations for non-production business areas like offices are listed as production auxiliary technology renovation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"仓储设施\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Warehousing facilities; renovation and repair are listed as technology/major overhaul projects, while new construction or expansion are listed as production auxiliary infrastructure.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"无人机库房\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Drone storage rooms; renovation and repair are listed as technology/major overhaul projects, while new construction or expansion are listed as production auxiliary infrastructure.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"通信及自动化机房\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Communication and automation machine rooms; renovation and repair are listed as technology/major overhaul projects, while new construction or expansion are listed as production auxiliary infrastructure.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"变电站\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Substations; production houses within them (control rooms, distribution rooms) and their new construction can be included in technology renovation. Facilities and line O&M support facilities inside substations are also technology renovation/major overhaul.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"关口计量表计\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Boundary metering devices; simultaneous new additions during substation equipment renovation can be included in technology renovation, but separate replacement belongs to marketing projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"一体化平台\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Enterprise Information Integration Platform, referred to as the integrated platform, which is a characteristic object of digital projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"PMS 功能模块\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Power Management System functional module; specifically the distribution rescue command platform, whose construction, renovation, and O&M should not be listed as production technology renovation/major overhaul projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"新一代调度系统\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Next-generation dispatching system located in Zone 3; considered an independent secondary project and a digital project, not a technology renovation category.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The implied organization referenced through terms like 'State Grid' in naming conventions and policy references like NDRC Order No. 27.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家发改委\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"